    "message": "[claude] X-51 round 16: muted town greenery and finer yard gravel\n\n- look.js: town rect mask (12-55 m feather) mutes meadow blades and sward\n  towards olive, keeps ~1/4 of flowers, damps the far flower wash\n- city.js: town-owned foliage copy desaturated, stronger leaf-clump shading\n- station.js: st-gravel repeat 1.9 (stones about half size)\n- main.js: town rect from city vegetationClearAreas\n- evidence/c-round16: before/after captures and README\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0184cGZMW5iiqkYAti6Puvej",
